{"id":"jeroham","name":"Jeroham","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:jeroham"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Jeroham","text":"Cherished; who finds mercy. (1.) Father of Elkanah, and grandfather of the prophet Samuel (1 Sam. 1:1). (2.) The father of Azareel, the “captain” of the tribe of Dan (1 Chr. 27:22). (3.) 1 Chr. 12:7; a Benjamite. (4.) 2 Chr. 23:1; one whose son assisted in placing Joash on the throne. (5.) 1 Chr. 9:8; a Benjamite. (6.) 1 Chr. 9:12; a priest, perhaps the same as in Neh. 11:12."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H3395","lemma":"יְרֹחָם","xlit":"Yᵉrôchâm","gloss":"Jerocham, the name of seven or eight Israelites","kjv":"Jeroham","count":10,"share":1},{"strong":"H5718","lemma":"עֲדָיָה","xlit":"ʻĂdâyâh","gloss":"Adajah, the name of eight Israelites","kjv":"Adaiah","count":3,"share":0.3},{"strong":"H511","lemma":"אֶלְקָנָה","xlit":"ʼElqânâh","gloss":"Elkanah, the name of several Israelites","kjv":"Elkanah","count":3,"share":0.3},{"strong":"H2147","lemma":"זִכְרִי","xlit":"Zikrîy","gloss":"Zicri, the name of twelve Israelites","kjv":"Zichri","count":2,"share":0.2},{"strong":"H6583","lemma":"פַּשְׁחוּר","xlit":"Pashchûwr","gloss":"Pashchur, the name of four Israelites","kjv":"Pashur","count":2,"share":0.2},{"strong":"H4441","lemma":"מַלְכִּיָּה","xlit":"Malkîyâh","gloss":"Malkijah, the name of ten Israelites","kjv":"Malchiah, Malchijah","count":2,"share":0.2}],"verses":["1Sam.1.1","1Chr.6.27","1Chr.6.34","1Chr.8.27","1Chr.9.8","1Chr.9.12","1Chr.12.7","1Chr.27.22","2Chr.23.1","Neh.11.12"],"related":[{"id":"adaiah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.188,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"elihu","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.15,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"elkanah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.111,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"eliab","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.103,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"adaiah","type":"lexical"